</div>
<div id=3D"outline-container-orgb68f7e6" class=3D"outline-3">
<h3 id=3D"orgb68f7e6">Continuing this thread, Thomas Gazagnaire announced</=
h3>
<div class=3D"outline-text-3" id=3D"text-orgb68f7e6">
<p>
I am happy to announce the release of <code>cascade</code> 1.2.1 in <code>o=
pam</code> and Homebrew. It mostly contains (many) bug fixes, a lot of them=
 found by rendering stylesheets in headless Chrome and comparing the pixels.
</p>

<p>
If you shipped minified CSS built with 1.1.0, please regenerate it and chec=
k the difference:
</p>

<pre class=3D"example" id=3D"org2fa129c">
$ cascade diff --diff=3Dcanonical old.css new.css
</pre>

<p>
If you want to check pixel-level differences of the rendering on a given pa=
ge, you can now use:
</p>

<pre class=3D"example" id=3D"org32b81bd">
$ cascade diff --browser --html page.html a.css b.css
</pre>

<p>
This new command helped to identify and fix numerous issues; hence the (way=
 too long) list of fixes in <a href=3D"https://github.com/samoht/cascade/bl=
ob/main/CHANGES.md#120">CHANGES.md</a>.
</p>
</div>
